{
  "id": "01-it-support-offer",
  "title": "Offer: Managed IT Support and Helpdesk Services",
  "approxPages": 3,
  "wordCount": 1501,
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Offer: Managed IT Support and Helpdesk Services"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Offer no. 2026-117 for [ORG_2], attention of [PERSON_1], Head of Finance and Administration. Prepared by [PERSON_2], Account Manager, [ORG_1]. Valid until [DATE_1]."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Introduction"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thank you for the constructive meeting at your headquarters on [DATE_2] and for the open discussion with your team about the current state of your IT. In this offer we describe how [ORG_1] can take over the day-to-day operation of your workplace IT, support your users through a central helpdesk and keep your servers and network secure and up to date."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "[ORG_1] has supported mid-sized manufacturing companies in the region for more than 15 years. Today we look after around 4,200 workstations for 38 customers, most of them family-owned businesses with between 100 and 600 employees. We know that a customer like you does not need a large IT department, but does need a reliable partner who answers the phone, understands production and keeps costs predictable."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Initial Situation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "[ORG_2] develops and builds packaging machines for the food and pharmaceutical industries. The company employs around 280 people at two sites: the headquarters with development, sales and administration, and the assembly plant about 40 kilometres away. Around 190 users work with a PC or laptop, and a further 35 production employees use shared terminals on the shop floor."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Until now, IT has been run by two internal employees who also support the ERP system and the CAD workstations in engineering. One of them will retire at the end of next year. During our meeting, the customer described the following challenges:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Support requests arrive by phone, email and in person, and there is no overview of open issues."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Security updates for clients and servers are installed irregularly, sometimes weeks after release."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The backup of the file servers is checked manually and has not been tested with a full restore for over a year."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "New employees often wait several days for a working laptop and the right access rights."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The assembly plant has no IT staff on site, so even small problems lead to long waiting times."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The customer's goal is to relieve the internal team of routine work so that it can focus on the ERP system, engineering applications and digital projects. At the same time, the customer wants a clear view of costs and service quality."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Scope of Services"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Our offer is modular. The core package covers the helpdesk, monitoring and patch management for all workstations and servers. On-site support and the onboarding service can be added as needed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Helpdesk"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Our helpdesk in [LOCATION_1] is the single point of contact for all users of [ORG_2]. Users can reach us by phone, by email or through our self-service portal. Every request is recorded as a ticket, prioritised and tracked until it is solved."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Service hours: Monday to Friday, 7:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m., excluding public holidays in Baden-Württemberg"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "First-level and second-level support for PCs and laptops, the office suite, email, printers and mobile devices"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Remote support with the user's consent, logged in the ticket"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Monthly report on ticket volumes, solution times and recurring problems"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Questions about the ERP system and the CAD software are forwarded to the internal team of the customer, as agreed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Monitoring and Patch Management"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We install a lightweight monitoring agent on all servers and workstations. It reports hardware faults, full disks, failed backups and missing updates to our operations centre around the clock. Critical alerts are handled immediately during service hours and the next morning outside them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Security updates for operating systems and standard applications are tested in a pilot group of ten devices and rolled out to all devices within "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "seven days"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of release. Critical updates for actively exploited vulnerabilities are rolled out within "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "48 hours"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Servers are patched in an agreed maintenance window on the first Saturday of each month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "On-site Support"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For tasks that cannot be solved remotely, a technician from [ORG_1] visits your sites. With the optional on-site package, a technician is present at the assembly plant every Tuesday and Thursday morning. Additional visits are invoiced per hour according to the price table below."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Onboarding and Offboarding"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "On request, we prepare new laptops, install the standard software, set up user accounts and hand the device over ready to use on the employee's first day. When an employee leaves, we revoke access on the same day, back up the mailbox and reset the device. HR only needs to send us the start or end date four working days in advance."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Transition Plan"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A smooth handover is the most important factor for a good start. We plan the transition in four steps over about four weeks, so that users notice as little as possible:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Kick-off workshop"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (week 1): two days with the internal IT team to agree on priorities, contacts, escalation paths and the maintenance window."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Inventory and documentation"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (weeks 1 to 2): we install the monitoring agents, record all devices, servers, licences and network components, and take over the existing documentation into our knowledge base."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "orderedList",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "listItem",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Review of the backup configuration and a first full restore test of one file server"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "listItem",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Check of the patch status of all servers, with a list of urgent gaps"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Pilot operation"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (week 3): the helpdesk starts for the IT team and two pilot departments, finance and purchasing, to test processes and phone routing."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Go-live"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (week 4): all users are informed by email and with a one-page guide, and the helpdesk takes over all requests."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "During the first eight weeks after go-live, a named service manager from [ORG_1] holds a short weekly call with the customer to review open tickets and adjust processes where needed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Service Levels"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We commit to the following service levels for helpdesk tickets during service hours:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Priority 1"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (production or a whole site affected): response within 30 minutes, workaround or solution targeted within 4 hours."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Priority 2"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (a department or a critical application affected): response within 1 hour, solution targeted within 8 hours."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Priority 3"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (a single user affected): response within 4 hours, solution targeted within 2 working days."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "Priority 4"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (requests and questions): response within 1 working day, handled as scheduled."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We measure the service levels every month and present the results in a short quarterly review with the customer. If we miss the response time for Priority 1 or Priority 2 tickets in more than 5 percent of cases in a quarter, the customer receives a credit of 5 percent of the monthly fee for that quarter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Responsibilities of the Customer"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "To deliver these services, we rely on the cooperation of the customer. In particular, the customer will name two contacts in the internal IT team who can take decisions on priorities and changes, grant our technicians remote access through the agreed VPN, and inform us in good time about new sites, larger orders of devices or changes to the ERP system. Software licences remain the responsibility of the customer unless they are purchased through [ORG_1]."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pricing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "All prices are in euros, net of VAT. The monthly fees are based on 190 users and 12 servers and will be adjusted quarterly to the actual numbers."
          }
        ]
      },
